<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to whenn</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
        .header { background: #1a1a1a; color: #fff; padding: 32px 40px; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; }
        .body { padding: 32px 40px; color: #333; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { padding: 24px 40px; color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to whenn 🎟</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
        <p>Hi {{ firstName }},</p>
        <p>Your account is ready. You can now browse events and purchase tickets.</p>
        <p>See you at the show.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        whenn — your ticket, your event.
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
